zh:
{message}
房间命令与当前应用或常驻后台的协议不兼容。请向用户报告原始错误；更新并重新打开 Belfry 应用后先用 belfry room status 核对，终端后台无需重启。
不要改用 belfry send 派房间任务，它不会写入房间任务板。响应失败时写入结果可能未知，先核对任务板，不要自动重复创建任务。

en:
{message}
Room commands are incompatible with the app or background service protocol. Report the original error to the user. Update and reopen Belfry, then check belfry room status; the terminal service does not need restarting.
Do not switch to belfry send for room tasks; it does not update the room task board. A failed response may leave the write result uncertain. Check the board before creating more tasks; do not automatically create duplicates.

zh:
协作房间协议不兼容：当前应用未能确认房间兼容通道，本次房间操作未发送。
{message}
请更新并重新打开 Belfry 应用后重试，现有终端后台无需重启。

en:
Incompatible room protocol: the app did not confirm a compatible room channel, so this operation was not sent.
{message}
Update and reopen Belfry before retrying; the existing terminal service does not need restarting.

